    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you hit a creature with a melee attack roll using a weapon or an Unarmed Strike, you can expend one Superiority Die to damage another creature within 5 feet of the original target and within your reach. If the original attack roll would hit the second creature, it takes damage equal to the number you roll on the Superiority Die, of the same type as the original attack's.</p>",
